    "http://purl.org/dc/terms/created": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date",
        "@value": "2024-09-30"
      }
    ],
    "http://purl.org/dc/terms/isPartOf": [
      {
        "@id": "https://rs.tdwg.org/bdqffdq/terms/"
      }
    ],
    "http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date",
        "@value": "2024-09-30"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A bdqffdq:InformationElement, expressed in concrete terms, about which a bdqffdq:DataQualityNeed expresses bdqffdq:Responses about the data quality in that bdqffdq:InformationElement."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "https://rs.tdwg.org/bdqffdq/terms/"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Acted Upon"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf": [
      {
        "@id": "https://rs.tdwg.org/bdqffdq/terms/InformationElement"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A bdqffdq:InformationElement, expressed in concrete terms, about which a bdqffdq:DataQualityNeed expresses bdqffdq:Responses about the data quality in that bdqffdq:InformationElement."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A bdqffdq:InformationElement to which a bdqffdq:ResponseResult applies."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Acted Upon"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://rs.tdwg.org/bdqffdq/terms/Amendment",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"
    ],
    "http://purl.org/dc/terms/created": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date",
        "@value": "2024-09-30"
      }
    ],
    "http://purl.org/dc/terms/isPartOf": [
      {
        "@id": "https://rs.tdwg.org/bdqffdq/terms/"
      }
    ],
    "http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date",
        "@value": "2024-09-30"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A bdqffdq:DataQualityNeed that expresses how proposals may be made to improve the fitness for use of data."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "https://rs.tdwg.org/bdqffdq/terms/"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Amendment"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf": [
      {
        "@id": "_:cb1bf3bc256fe4be09743ec24508d73bbc4897bb8d77a539b208c66e17da1c59549"
      },
      {
        "@id": "_:cb25252cb9491d3f6aa57c346291726025df00ab252e9e51e18a9c6a3b58fd9240a"
      },
      {
        "@id": "https://rs.tdwg.org/bdqffdq/terms/AmendmentConcept"
      },
      {
        "@id": "https://rs.tdwg.org/bdqffdq/terms/DataQualityNeed"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A bdqffdq:DataQualityNeed that expresses how proposals may be made to improve the fitness for use of data."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "ContextualizedEnhancement in the original framework. Describes an instance of a bdqffdq:Enhancement in the context of the associated bdqffdq:InformationElements from a controlled vocabulary (fields bdqffdq:ActedUpon or bdqffdq:Consulted), and a bdqffdq:ResourceType of bdqffdq:SingleRecord or bdqffdq:MultiRecord.\n\nDescribes a proposal for a bdqffdq:Enhancement of original data, which if accepted, would improve the quality of the data for a use. For example: 'Recommends valid value for taxon name in a Single Record.'\n\nbdqffdq:Amendments may describe proposed changes to data values, or proposed changes to processes for the production and manipulation of data, for example, a bdqffdq:Amendment on a bdqffdq:SingleRecord may provide bdqffdq:Criteria for proposing that dwc:decimalLatitude and dwc:decimalLongitude are transposed in that record. Similarly, a bdqffdq:Amendment on a bdqffdq:MultiRecord may provide bdqffdq:Critera for proposing that all dwc:decimalLatitudes and dwc:decimalLongitudes from a data source have been transposed, and the mapping of data values to transport terms should be changed.\n\nA bdqffdq:Amendment is the bdqffdq:DataQualityNeed that parallels a bdqffdq:AmendmentMethod in the Solutions layer (see Figure 3 in Veiga et al., 2017), and a bdqffdq:AmendmentResponse in the Report layer (see Figure 3 in Veiga et al., 2017).\n\nAM = { am | am = < ie, e, d, rt >, ie ∈ IE, e ∈ E, d ∈ D ⋀ rt ∈ RT }"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Amendment"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://rs.tdwg.org/bdqffdq/terms/AmendmentConcept",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"
    ],
    "http://purl.org/dc/terms/created": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date",
        "@value": "2024-09-30"
      }
    ],
    "http://purl.org/dc/terms/isPartOf": [
      {
        "@id": "https://rs.tdwg.org/bdqffdq/terms/"
      }
    ],
    "http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date",
        "@value": "2024-09-30"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A term involved in proposals of changes to data or process to improve data quality to fit an expressed bdqffdq:DataQualityNeed."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "https://rs.tdwg.org/bdqffdq/terms/"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Amendment Concept"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A term involved in proposals of changes to data or process to improve data quality to fit an expressed bdqffdq:DataQualityNeed."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Amendment Concept"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://rs.tdwg.org/bdqffdq/terms/AmendmentMethod",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"
    ],
    "http://purl.org/dc/terms/created": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date",
        "@value": "2024-09-30"
      }
    ],
    "http://purl.org/dc/terms/isPartOf": [
      {
        "@id": "https://rs.tdwg.org/bdqffdq/terms/"
      }
    ],
    "http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date",
        "@value": "2024-09-30"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A data quality bdqffdq:SolutionsConcept that relates a bdqffdq:Amendment to its bdqffdq:Specifications."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "https://rs.tdwg.org/bdqffdq/terms/"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Amendment Method"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf": [
      {
        "@id": "_:cb1e33d19bf603f868ac63b99527ee8b0820a43a4d65bf570b089a3245aba0a87e6"
      },
      {
        "@id": "https://rs.tdwg.org/bdqffdq/terms/AmendmentConcept"
      },
      {
        "@id": "https://rs.tdwg.org/bdqffdq/terms/DataQualityMethod"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A data quality bdqffdq:SolutionsConcept that relates a bdqffdq:Amendment to its bdqffdq:Specifications."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The bdqffdq:AmendmentMethod is a bdqffdq:DataQualityMethod describing the relationship between a bdqffdq:Specification (technical description of a Test) and a bdqffdq:Amendment (a bdqffdq:Enhancement in the context of bdqffdq:ResourceType (bdqffdq:SingleRecord or bdqffdq:MultiRecord) and associated bdqffdq:InformationElements).\n\nAMM(am) = { s | s ∈ S ⋀ (am, s) ∈ rel_AMM }"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Amendment Method"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://rs.tdwg.org/bdqffdq/terms/AmendmentPolicy",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"
    ],
    "http://purl.org/dc/terms/created": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date",
        "@value": "2024-09-30"
      }
    ],
    "http://purl.org/dc/terms/isPartOf": [
      {
        "@id": "https://rs.tdwg.org/bdqffdq/terms/"
      }
    ],
    "http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date",
        "@value": "2024-09-30"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A bdqffdq:NeedConcept that relates a bdqffdq:UseCase to a set of supporting bdqffdq:Amendments."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "https://rs.tdwg.org/bdqffdq/terms/"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Amendment Policy"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf": [
      {
        "@id": "https://rs.tdwg.org/bdqffdq/terms/AmendmentConcept"
      },
      {
        "@id": "https://rs.tdwg.org/bdqffdq/terms/Policy"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A bdqffdq:NeedConcept that relates a bdqffdq:UseCase to a set of supporting bdqffdq:Amendments."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A data quality Need layer concept (see Figure 3 in Veiga et al., 2017) that describes how a bdqffdq:Amendment relates to a bdqffdq:UseCase. This relationship defines which bdqffdq:Amendments are supported by a given bdqffdq:UseCase.\n\nAP(u) = { am | am ∈ AM ⋀ (u, am) ∈ rel_AP }"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Amendment Policy"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://rs.tdwg.org/bdqffdq/terms/AmendmentResponse",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"
    ],
    "http://purl.org/dc/terms/created": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date",
        "@value": "2026-04-13"
      }
    ],
    "http://purl.org/dc/terms/isPartOf": [
      {
        "@id": "https://rs.tdwg.org/bdqffdq/terms/"
      }
    ],
    "http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date",
        "@value": "2026-04-13"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A bdqffdq:Response expressing the result of a bdqffdq:Implementation evaluating a bdqffdq:Amendment supporting a particular bdqffdq:DataQualityNeed to improve a particular bdqffdq:DataResource."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "https://rs.tdwg.org/bdqffdq/terms/"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Amendment Response"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf": [
      {
        "@id": "https://rs.tdwg.org/bdqffdq/terms/AmendmentConcept"
      },
      {
        "@id": "https://rs.tdwg.org/bdqffdq/terms/Response"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A bdqffdq:Response expressing the result of a bdqffdq:Implementation evaluating a bdqffdq:Amendment supporting a particular bdqffdq:DataQualityNeed to improve a particular bdqffdq:DataResource."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The bdqffdq:AmendmentResponse type is a Report layer concept (see Figure 3 in Veiga et al., 2017) that describes the results of the execution of a Test that performs a bdqffdq:AmendmentMethod following a bdqffdq:Specification to propose changes based on a bdqffdq:Amendment. \n\nA bdqffdq:AmendmentResponse is expected to carry, through bdqffdq:hasResponseStatus, a bdqffdq:ResponseStatus result that includes a status bdqffdq:FILLED_IN or bdqffdq:AMENDED, as well as a bdqffdq:hasResponseResultValue that asserts proposed changes to values from the original data.\n\nDQA(dr) = { dqa | dqa ∈ RespA ⋀ (dr, dqa) ∈ rel_DQA }"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Amendment Response"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://rs.tdwg.org/bdqffdq/terms/Argument",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"
    ],
    "http://purl.org/dc/terms/created": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date",
        "@value": "2024-09-30"
      }
    ],
    "http://purl.org/dc/terms/isPartOf": [
      {
        "@id": "https://rs.tdwg.org/bdqffdq/terms/"
      }
    ],
    "http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date",
        "@value": "2024-09-30"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A value that, when provided to a Test bdqffdq:Specification to replace a bdqffdq:Parameter changes the behavior of the Test in a defined manner."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "https://rs.tdwg.org/bdqffdq/terms/"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Argument"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf": [
      {
        "@id": "https://rs.tdwg.org/bdqffdq/terms/SolutionsConcept"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A value that, when provided to a Test bdqffdq:Specification to replace a bdqffdq:Parameter changes the behavior of the Test in a defined manner."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The bdqffdq:Argument is an Actual Parameter, for which a bdqffdq:Parameter is the corresponding Formal Parameter. An extension to the original fitness for use framework as described in Veiga et al., 2017."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Argument"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://rs.tdwg.org/bdqffdq/terms/COMPLETE",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual",
      "https://rs.tdwg.org/bdqffdq/terms/ResponseResult"
    ],
    "http://purl.org/dc/terms/created": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date",
        "@value": "2024-09-30"
      }
    ],
    "http://purl.org/dc/terms/isPartOf": [
      {
        "@id": "https://rs.tdwg.org/bdqffdq/terms/"
      }
    ],
    "http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date",
        "@value": "2026-11-09"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A bdqffdq:ResponseResult of a bdqffdq:Measure that asserts that data are present and sufficiently comprehensive for use."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "https://rs.tdwg.org/bdqffdq/terms/"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "COMPLETE"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A bdqffdq:ResponseResult of a bdqffdq:Measure that asserts that data are present and sufficiently comprehensive for use."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation": [
      {
        "@value": "COMPLETE"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This value can be used to filter data for bdqffdq:QualityAssurance. This value can be asserted, for example, by bdqffdq:Measures of bdqffdq:MultiRecords where all the bdqffdq:Validation bdqffdq:ResponseResults from all included records in the dataset are bdqffdq:COMPLIANT."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "COMPLETE"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://rs.tdwg.org/bdqffdq/terms/COMPLIANT",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual",
      "https://rs.tdwg.org/bdqffdq/terms/ResponseResult"
    ],
    "http://purl.org/dc/terms/created": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date",
        "@value": "2024-09-30"
      }
    ],
    "http://purl.org/dc/terms/isPartOf": [
      {
        "@id": "https://rs.tdwg.org/bdqffdq/terms/"
      }
    ],
    "http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date",
        "@value": "2026-11-09"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A bdqffdq:ResponseResult of a bdqffdq:Validation where the data conforms to the bdqffdq:Criteria for quality in the Test bdqffdq:Specification."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "https://rs.tdwg.org/bdqffdq/terms/"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "COMPLIANT"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A bdqffdq:ResponseResult of a bdqffdq:Validation where the data conforms to the bdqffdq:Criteria for quality in the Test bdqffdq:Specification."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation": [
      {
        "@value": "COMPLIANT"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "COMPLIANT"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://rs.tdwg.org/bdqffdq/terms/Consulted",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"
    ],
    "http://purl.org/dc/terms/created": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date",
        "@value": "2024-09-30"
      }
    ],
    "http://purl.org/dc/terms/isPartOf": [
      {
        "@id": "https://rs.tdwg.org/bdqffdq/terms/"
      }
    ],
    "http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date",
        "@value": "2024-09-30"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A bdqffdq:InformationElement, expressed in concrete terms, about which a bdqffdq:DataQualityNeed examines in order to expresses bdqffdq:Responses about the data quality in another bdqffdq:InformationElement."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "https://rs.tdwg.org/bdqffdq/terms/"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Consulted"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf": [
      {
        "@id": "https://rs.tdwg.org/bdqffdq/terms/InformationElement"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A bdqffdq:InformationElement, expressed in concrete terms, about which a bdqffdq:DataQualityNeed examines in order to expresses bdqffdq:Responses about the data quality in another bdqffdq:InformationElement."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A bdqffdq:InformationElement the content of which is examined to assert a result on one or more other bdqffdq:InformationElements."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Consulted"
      }
    ]
  },
